# The Windows engine's build inputs are hashed byte for byte against
# tools/bughouse_windows/build.json. A Windows checkout would otherwise turn
# their LF into CRLF and every Windows build would call the engine stale.
tools/bughouse_windows/** -text

# Meow Chess's built web app, copied in from the Meow-Chess repo: served
# byte for byte, and its minified files make unreadable diffs.
python/twic-position-finder/frontend/public/meow-chess/** -text -diff
